{"seq":2,"slug":"signal-core-concept","title":"信号的核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/signal-core-concept","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"信号的核心概念\">信号的核心概念</h1><p>很多人第一次看到 <code>const [count, setCount] = createSignal(0)</code> 会以为信号就是「换了个写法的状态变量」。但如果信号只是变量，框架就无从知道谁依赖了它。信号真正的魔法不在「写」，而在「<strong>读也是一个可被观察的事件</strong>」——读一个信号会在系统里留下痕迹，正是这道痕迹让自动响应成为可能。这一篇把信号这个原语本身从里到外讲清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个信号是一个<strong>带有读追踪能力的可观察值单元</strong>。它至少暴露两种操作：读（get）和写（set）。关键区别在于，普通变量的读只是返回值，而信号的读会同时做一件事——把「当前正在执行的计算」登记为自己的订阅者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  W[&quot;写 set(v)&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;信号 cell&lt;br/&gt;存值 + 订阅者列表&quot;]&#10;  R[&quot;读 get()&quot;] --&gt; S&#10;  R -.-&gt;|登记当前观察者| S&#10;  S --&gt;|值变化时通知| O1[&quot;订阅者:computed&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|值变化时通知| O2[&quot;订阅者:effect / DOM 绑定&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  W[\"写 set(v)\"] --&gt; S[\"信号 cell&lt;br/&gt;存值 + 订阅者列表\"]\n  R[\"读 get()\"] --&gt; S\n  R -.-&gt;|登记当前观察者| S\n  S --&gt;|值变化时通知| O1[\"订阅者:computed\"]\n  S --&gt;|值变化时通知| O2[\"订阅者:effect / DOM 绑定\"]</pre><p>按职责，响应式图里的节点分三类，信号是其中的「源」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>是否持有自有状态</th>\n<th>是否可被读追踪</th>\n<th>是否会触发副作用</th>\n<th>典型 API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号（source）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>createSignal</code> / <code>ref</code> / <code>signal</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派生值（computed）</td>\n<td>否（缓存）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>createMemo</code> / <code>computed</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副作用（effect）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>createEffect</code> / <code>watchEffect</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本篇只讲第一类「源」；派生值与副作用的定义见<a href=\"../mechanisms/computed-and-effects\">计算值与副作用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"getter-setter-形态-为什么读必须是函数调用\">getter/setter 形态：为什么读必须是函数调用</h2><p>Solid 把信号设计成 <code>[get, set]</code> 一对函数，这不是风格选择，而是机制的必然。要在「读」的那一刻插入「登记订阅者」的逻辑，读就必须是一次<strong>可拦截的调用</strong>。函数调用天然提供了这个拦截点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const [count, setCount] = createSignal(0);&#10;console.log(count()); // 读 —— 此刻框架记录「谁在读」&#10;setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1); // 写 —— 此刻框架通知所有读过的人\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const [count, setCount] = createSignal(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(count()); // 读 —— 此刻框架记录「谁在读」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setCount((c) => c + 1); // 写 —— 此刻框架通知所有读过的人</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果信号是裸值 <code>let count = 0</code>，读 <code>count</code> 是一次纯属性访问，JS 没有办法在引擎层面拦截它（除非借助 Proxy 或编译期改写）。这正是各框架形态分化的根源：Solid 用显式函数调用，Vue 用 <code>.value</code> 配合 Proxy 拦截（见<a href=\"../frameworks/vue-reactivity\">Vue 响应式系统</a>），Svelte 用编译期把 <code>$state</code> 变量的读写改写成函数调用（见<a href=\"../frameworks/angular-svelte-signals\">Angular Signals 与 Svelte Runes</a>）。形态不同，但「读必须可被拦截」这个本质完全一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拉取与推送-信号是-push-pull-混合模型\">拉取与推送：信号是 push-pull 混合模型</h2><p>天真的实现会在「写」时立即递归通知并重算所有下游，这叫纯 <strong>push</strong>。问题是：如果一个信号被改了十次但中间没人读，纯 push 会白白重算十次。</p>\n<p>成熟的信号系统是 <strong>push-pull 混合</strong>：写信号时只做一件轻量的事——把下游标记为「脏」（push 一个失效通知），但<strong>不立即重算</strong>；真正的重算推迟到下游被<strong>读取</strong>时才发生（pull）。这套「写时标脏、读时拉值」的设计让信号天然具备惰性与按需计算的特性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SET[&quot;set(v)&quot;] --&gt;|push: 标记下游为脏| D[&quot;computed 标记 dirty&quot;]&#10;  GET[&quot;读 computed()&quot;] --&gt;|pull: 若脏则重算| D&#10;  D --&gt;|重算后缓存| V[&quot;返回缓存值&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  SET[\"set(v)\"] --&gt;|push: 标记下游为脏| D[\"computed 标记 dirty\"]\n  GET[\"读 computed()\"] --&gt;|pull: 若脏则重算| D\n  D --&gt;|重算后缓存| V[\"返回缓存值\"]</pre><p>这个模型解释了一个常被误解的现象：在很多框架里，连续多次写同一个信号、却没有任何读取时，派生值并不会被反复计算——它只会在下次被读到时算一次。具体的标脏传播与重算时序，属于调度问题，见<a href=\"../mechanisms/scheduling-batching\">调度与批处理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无毛刺-信号系统的正确性底线\">无毛刺：信号系统的正确性底线</h2><p>「无毛刺（glitch-free）」是评判一个响应式系统是否正确的关键性质。考虑一个经典的菱形依赖：信号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 派生出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = A + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = A + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，再有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = B + C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 变到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正确（无毛刺）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 都更新后被观察到一次，值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>有毛刺：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 先看到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 更新（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 还是旧值），短暂地等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>，再变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>——这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 就是「毛刺」，一个本不该被观察到的中间状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>形式化地说，无毛刺要求：对任意一次状态更新，每个派生节点在一轮传播中<strong>至多被观察到一次最终值</strong>，且这个值与「从头同步重算整张图」的结果一致。保证它需要按依赖图的拓扑序更新，这正是调度层的核心职责，详见<a href=\"../mechanisms/scheduling-batching\">调度与批处理</a>。这里只需记住：信号之所以能替代手写订阅而不出错，无毛刺是不可妥协的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等值判定-传播的天然刹车\">等值判定：传播的天然刹车</h2><p>信号还有一个朴素但极重要的优化：<strong>写入与旧值相等时不传播</strong>。多数实现默认用 <code>Object.is</code>（或 <code>===</code>）比较新旧值，相等就直接返回，连标脏都省了。派生值同理——<code>createMemo</code> 若重算后的输出与上次 <code>===</code> 相等，下游就不会被通知。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const [n, setN] = createSignal(5);&#10;setN(5); // 与旧值相等 → 不触发任何下游\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const [n, setN] = createSignal(5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setN(5); // 与旧值相等 → 不触发任何下游</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这让等值判定成为响应式图里一道天然的「截断阀」：变化在值不再实际改变的那一层就停止传播。在实践中可以通过自定义 <code>equals</code> 比较器来调节这道阀的灵敏度，例如对对象做浅比较或干脆关闭去重。这个机制在性能调优时反复出现，是「为什么改了值下游却没更新」这类问题的常见根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>信号是带读追踪的可观察值：读会登记订阅者，写会通知订阅者——魔法在「读」而非「写」。</li>\n<li>读必须可被拦截，所以才有 getter 函数、<code>.value</code> Proxy、编译期改写三种形态，本质相同。</li>\n<li>信号是 push-pull 混合：写时标脏（push），读时才重算（pull），天然惰性。</li>\n<li>无毛刺是正确性底线：任何派生值一轮内至多被观察到一次最终值，需拓扑序保证。</li>\n<li>等值判定（默认 <code>Object.is</code>）是传播的天然刹车，也是调优与排错的高频考点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信号的核心概念","id":"信号的核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"getter/setter 形态：为什么读必须是函数调用","id":"getter-setter-形态-为什么读必须是函数调用"},{"level":2,"text":"拉取与推送：信号是 push-pull 混合模型","id":"拉取与推送-信号是-push-pull-混合模型"},{"level":2,"text":"无毛刺：信号系统的正确性底线","id":"无毛刺-信号系统的正确性底线"},{"level":2,"text":"等值判定：传播的天然刹车","id":"等值判定-传播的天然刹车"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"响应式模型的演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/reactivity-models-evolution"},"next":{"title":"依赖追踪与自动订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/dependency-tracking"}}